WEBVTT

00:04.620 --> 00:08.230
The students of the Misfit Class
were given a task.

00:08.470 --> 00:13.550
If they do not all advance to the
Dalet rank before their second year,

00:13.550 --> 00:18.870
they will be kicked out of the Royal One,
which they worked so hard to acquire.

00:19.170 --> 00:21.240
Due to their work during
the Harvest Festival,

00:21.240 --> 00:24.420
Iruma and Lead, happily,
were promoted to Dalet.

00:24.420 --> 00:28.000
Will the rest of their
classmates be able to reach Dalet

00:28.000 --> 00:31.670
before their limited days
as first-years are over?

00:34.630 --> 00:37.510
The night after the Harvest Festival ended...

00:38.130 --> 00:43.140
There was an "Iruma-kun, Great Job at the
Harvest Festival" party at the Sullivan house...

00:45.850 --> 00:48.360
Great Job

00:46.360 --> 00:51.500
an "Alice-chan, Great Job at the Harvest
Festival" party at the Asmodeus house...

00:52.490 --> 00:58.490
We're Home

00:53.070 --> 00:58.490
and a "Clara, Great Job at the Harvest
Festival" party at Clara's house.

00:58.490 --> 00:59.990
Welcome home, Clara.

00:59.990 --> 01:01.240
Welcome home, Nee-chan!

01:01.240 --> 01:02.780
Eat plenty today!

01:02.780 --> 01:05.200
Make sure you get plenty of
rest tonight in a warm futon.

01:05.200 --> 01:08.200
Yessir, Mommy, Konchie, and Keebow!

01:08.200 --> 01:11.480
Sin Sin, Ran Ran, I'm home!

01:12.880 --> 01:15.860
Meanwhile, the instructors of Babyls

01:12.880 --> 01:15.860
Reserved

01:15.860 --> 01:19.840
were also having their own
party for a job well done.

01:15.860 --> 01:19.850
Knucklebone Mountain

01:19.840 --> 01:22.020
Attention, everyone!

01:19.850 --> 01:27.600
Today's
Host

01:22.020 --> 01:24.650
Great job at the Harvest Festival this year!

01:24.650 --> 01:25.990
Devil...

01:25.990 --> 01:27.600
Cheers!

03:00.030 --> 03:04.530
The Instructors' Banquet

03:00.300 --> 03:02.280
"The Instructors' Banquet."

03:02.280 --> 03:03.300
Yis!

03:05.040 --> 03:06.620
It looks so good!

03:06.620 --> 03:09.160
Yis! Make sure you eat plenty of salad.

03:09.660 --> 03:13.460
My class never listens to a word I say...

03:14.130 --> 03:17.160
Blushenko-sensei, you seem to get drunk fast.

03:17.160 --> 03:18.220
Let's see...

03:18.220 --> 03:22.300
Furcas-sensei and Raim-sensei are
out because they're on duty...

03:22.300 --> 03:24.580
So the ones who aren't here
yet are Orias-sensei,

03:24.580 --> 03:27.170
Kalego-sensei, and Balam-sensei.

03:27.800 --> 03:31.420
Orias-sensei can't drink alcohol,
so he might not show up.

03:31.420 --> 03:34.150
Kalego-sensei never shows up,
even if we invite him.

03:34.150 --> 03:36.400
Each and every single time!

03:37.450 --> 03:38.980
Welcome!

03:38.980 --> 03:40.810
Service from our hearts!

03:40.810 --> 03:42.950
Service from our hearts!

03:44.080 --> 03:46.080
Oh, hello.

03:47.910 --> 03:49.190
Sensei!

03:49.200 --> 03:50.890
Kalego-sensei?!

03:50.890 --> 03:52.490
Seriously?! Is that really him?!

03:52.490 --> 03:54.500
But he never comes out to drink with us!

03:54.500 --> 03:56.250
He doesn't look like he belongs in a pub!

03:57.270 --> 04:00.470
It's a miracle! A miracle!

04:00.470 --> 04:02.080
Here we go.

04:02.080 --> 04:04.830
He was trying to leave, so I caught him.

04:04.830 --> 04:07.360
Thank goodness we asked
Balam-sensei to take care of this.

04:07.360 --> 04:10.430
Hey! I'm the host today!

04:10.430 --> 04:12.440
So they're behind this.

04:12.440 --> 04:16.190
Well done, Balam-sensei and Robin-sensei!

04:17.450 --> 04:18.940
Come on, praise me!

04:19.760 --> 04:21.790
And just what am I
expected to praise you for?

04:21.790 --> 04:23.120
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

04:23.120 --> 04:24.950
Aw, you're such good friends.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.320
What're you drinking?

04:27.320 --> 04:28.880
Anything is fine.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.200
They even have wine!

04:30.200 --> 04:32.650
Also, the chair-demon is covering the tab—

04:32.080 --> 04:35.770
Daikoku
Makyo

04:32.650 --> 04:36.160
I'll have the Daikoku Makyo from 6,666.

04:36.160 --> 04:37.480
The Pearl of Evil.

04:37.480 --> 04:40.470
H-He didn't even hesitate to order
the most expensive alcohol...

04:40.960 --> 04:44.180
Uh, that's really strong alcohol...

04:44.180 --> 04:45.960
Oh, I'll be the one drinking it.

04:53.640 --> 04:56.280
You can really hold your
liquor, Balam-sensei.

04:56.280 --> 04:57.100
Somewhat.

04:57.100 --> 04:59.260
Hi, hi! I want some, too!

04:59.260 --> 05:02.380
You might not be ready for
this just yet, Robin-sensei.

05:02.380 --> 05:03.320
What?!

05:03.320 --> 05:05.100
What kind of bar snacks would you like?

05:05.100 --> 05:08.570
They have fried chicken, pickled
vegetables, barbecued chicken...

05:08.570 --> 05:13.600
Bird, bird, bird, bird...

05:10.570 --> 05:11.860
Sorry about that...

05:11.860 --> 05:13.590
Why are you apologizing?

05:15.670 --> 05:18.560
You don't like barbecued
chicken, Jimmy-sensei?

05:18.560 --> 05:22.080
This is Marbas-sensei. And you teach...?

05:22.210 --> 05:27.970
Art of Torture              Marbas March

05:22.820 --> 05:24.230
I teach the art of torture.

05:24.950 --> 05:27.960
Marbas March. Teaches the art of torture.

05:27.960 --> 05:29.200
How surprising!

05:29.200 --> 05:32.200
You totally seem like a Jimmy
'cause you look so dull!

05:32.200 --> 05:33.840
You don't hold back, do you?

05:33.840 --> 05:35.970
My family is pretty artistic.

05:35.970 --> 05:38.380
Do you have any siblings?

05:38.380 --> 05:42.350
Well, I have an older sister who's
a manager for a dem-dol.

05:40.020 --> 05:43.230
Maru-san!!

05:42.350 --> 05:43.240
What?!

05:43.240 --> 05:45.920
Wow, that's amazing! Which dem-dol?!

05:45.920 --> 05:47.240
I can't tell you.

05:47.240 --> 05:49.990
Come on, tell me!

05:48.910 --> 05:49.990
Nope.

05:50.410 --> 05:53.240
Speaking of relatives...

05:54.950 --> 05:56.920
Come, now, have some kobucha.

05:56.920 --> 06:00.420
Er, Grandfather... I'm going to
have some alcohol, as well...

06:00.420 --> 06:01.420
Absolutely not!

06:01.420 --> 06:03.960
Not when all these men are around,
free to do as they please!

06:05.240 --> 06:07.200
Ow, ow, ow!

06:07.570 --> 06:09.090
Grandfather!

06:09.090 --> 06:11.040
He's creating a barricade.

06:11.040 --> 06:12.550
A grandpa guard...

06:12.550 --> 06:14.940
Must be rough working with your relatives.

06:14.940 --> 06:16.310
Momonoki-sensei!

06:17.970 --> 06:20.860
Come over here!

06:22.100 --> 06:23.980
There's a seat over here!

06:23.980 --> 06:25.480
I'm right next to him!

06:23.980 --> 06:29.490
Right next to him!!

06:25.480 --> 06:29.500
R-Right next to him, right next to him,
right next to him, right next to him...

06:29.500 --> 06:32.120
Tonight, we're all equals!

06:32.470 --> 06:34.360
The loud one came back...

06:35.130 --> 06:38.640
R-Right next to him, right next to him,
right next to him, right next to him...

06:38.640 --> 06:42.800
So, hey. What were you like as
a new teacher, Momonoki-sensei?

06:42.800 --> 06:46.590
Wh-When I was a new teacher...

06:47.760 --> 06:52.070
Kalego-sensei was my mentor,
a-and he took really good care...

06:52.070 --> 06:53.170
You're just like me!

06:53.170 --> 06:54.260
Huh?

06:54.260 --> 06:58.260
Then, hey, who was your
mentor, Kalego-sensei?

06:58.260 --> 06:59.140
W-Well...

06:59.140 --> 07:00.890
Who was it? Who was it?!

07:01.450 --> 07:02.570
It was me!

07:02.520 --> 07:05.150
Instructor Supervisor          Dantalion Dali

07:02.570 --> 07:05.030
The instructor supervisor, Dantalion Dali.

07:05.030 --> 07:06.900
Huh?!

07:06.900 --> 07:08.240
I say he's lying.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.330
I say he's joking.

07:09.330 --> 07:11.810
I say that he's drunk.

07:11.810 --> 07:14.160
That's you right now.

07:14.160 --> 07:18.040
Jeez, no trust at all in what I say.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.880
Well, we definitely
didn't get along at first.

07:20.880 --> 07:22.090
Please...

07:22.090 --> 07:23.300
It's true.

07:23.300 --> 07:25.230
What?! It is?!

07:25.230 --> 07:27.040
Yis! It's totally true!

07:27.040 --> 07:30.080
Wow, I had no idea.

07:30.080 --> 07:33.700
He wasn't very nice. He was cold and harsh...

07:33.700 --> 07:35.180
Well, I guess he still is.

07:36.400 --> 07:37.450
Pleasure.

07:37.450 --> 07:38.820
Right.

07:38.820 --> 07:39.960
Man, you're gloomy.

07:39.960 --> 07:41.320
Right.

07:41.560 --> 07:44.640
When I said the new instructors
usually host the mixers,

07:44.640 --> 07:47.440
he ended up getting a reservation
at a super classy restaurant,

07:47.440 --> 07:49.350
and it was super expensive.

07:49.350 --> 07:51.570
It's the place I always go to.

07:51.570 --> 07:55.930
He always did his work perfectly,
but he was so hard to approach.

07:56.440 --> 07:57.590
Really?

07:58.360 --> 08:01.070
But to think that Kalego-sensei...

08:01.070 --> 08:06.090
is now BFFs with the
members of the Misfit Class.

08:08.400 --> 08:09.590
What?!

08:09.590 --> 08:11.200
Wait, was I wrong?

08:11.200 --> 08:14.050
Yis. But they're all amazing students.

08:14.050 --> 08:16.520
Especially Iruma-kun.

08:17.480 --> 08:19.690
There's the kid everyone's talking about!

08:19.690 --> 08:23.470
I was devi surprised when I heard
he was the chair-demon's grandson.

08:25.760 --> 08:27.520
Aberuhauke...

08:29.690 --> 08:33.070
Sutoumanu

08:32.820 --> 08:35.610
Aberuge

08:36.000 --> 08:37.000
Uru...

08:38.440 --> 08:40.200
Tsurezaza.

08:42.720 --> 08:44.040
No way!

08:44.040 --> 08:45.940
Seriously?!

08:44.820 --> 08:46.500
Holy crap!

08:46.500 --> 08:48.200
It all makes sense now.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.720
It sure does.

08:49.720 --> 08:52.450
Yis. Ever since the entrance ceremony,

08:52.450 --> 08:54.450
he's had command over the honor student.

08:56.230 --> 08:57.550
Something's coming!

09:00.020 --> 09:03.600
During the race, he brought over
the Guardian of Cutthroat Valley.

09:03.600 --> 09:05.060
Quan Quan.

09:05.060 --> 09:08.720
Then he made those pink flowers bloom, yis!

09:09.380 --> 09:11.150
And then, at the Battler Party...

09:11.360 --> 09:12.640
One!

09:12.640 --> 09:15.350
Zero!

09:19.750 --> 09:21.530
It bloomed!

09:20.120 --> 09:21.530
Iruma-sama!

09:21.530 --> 09:24.180
Those sure were devi beautiful.

09:24.180 --> 09:27.400
And, most importantly,
he's Kalego-sensei's maste—

09:29.320 --> 09:31.160
Whoops, my bad.

09:33.060 --> 09:35.800
And he opened up the Royal One.

09:35.800 --> 09:37.730
Yis. That was totally unexpected.

09:38.430 --> 09:41.360
The area that has been closed off
to everyone at this school,

09:41.360 --> 09:44.460
the Royal One, shall be opened!

09:52.990 --> 09:55.560
The Royal One has been opened!

10:07.240 --> 10:10.240
And then the incident at Walter Park.

10:19.760 --> 10:21.390
Razoro Flame

10:32.870 --> 10:35.370
That certainly was terrifying.

10:35.370 --> 10:40.390
You took on such a troublesome
class, Kalego-sensei.

10:41.320 --> 10:44.140
Yes! Talk about flashy!

10:44.140 --> 10:47.120
Yeah, we just can't let
them out of our sight.

10:47.470 --> 10:51.370
Students and teachers
are like family, after all!

10:51.370 --> 10:52.440
No.

10:58.260 --> 11:00.820
Huh? Huh? What?

11:00.820 --> 11:02.520
Robin-sensei.

11:03.340 --> 11:08.680
The young talent at Babyls will
breathe new life into the netherworld.

11:08.680 --> 11:10.790
The Misfit Class, as well as all of

11:10.790 --> 11:14.170
the other students, are a
treasure to the netherworld.

11:14.170 --> 11:17.080
And... we are their guardians.

11:17.860 --> 11:20.900
We only have one goal.

11:26.970 --> 11:31.750
Our utmost priority is to
protect our precious students.

11:31.750 --> 11:34.000
This is our pledge.

11:34.400 --> 11:39.750
Any enemy that goes after our treasure
shall receive the gruesome "discipline."

11:43.000 --> 11:45.190
All right! Cheers, everyone!

11:45.190 --> 11:47.000
Devil!

11:48.480 --> 11:50.520
Ooh, right on cue.

11:50.840 --> 11:54.710
The nerve of using our
historical motto as a toast.

11:56.880 --> 11:58.020
Does he really...

11:58.020 --> 12:02.020
Demon, demon...

11:58.680 --> 12:01.020
do this every time?

12:02.570 --> 12:06.030
Anyway, that is our oath.

12:06.920 --> 12:07.780
Right!

12:10.590 --> 12:11.790
New instructor.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.520
Yes?

12:13.520 --> 12:17.180
Make sure you carve
that motto into your heart.

12:18.440 --> 12:21.880
Any enemy that goes after our treasure
shall receive the gruesome "discipline."

12:22.500 --> 12:26.680
Your actions today were
also based on our motto.

12:27.520 --> 12:28.670
Right!

12:28.670 --> 12:31.680
Let's rewind a few hours back.

12:32.840 --> 12:36.720
Right around when Iruma and Lead
were given the title of Young King...

12:36.720 --> 12:39.990
Hey, what the heck? Where'd Robin-sensei go?

12:39.990 --> 12:44.610
Uh, hello?! Your pupil won here!

12:44.610 --> 12:45.980
Robin-sensei!

12:55.710 --> 13:00.300
Bullseye

12:55.710 --> 13:00.300
Shot

13:04.250 --> 13:07.520
Yay! I got all the data I wanted.

13:07.520 --> 13:11.190
The Harvest Festival was
so much fun! Doot doo-doo!

13:11.190 --> 13:14.440
I got into the school pretty easily,

13:14.440 --> 13:17.530
and if I just tinker with
Orobas-kun's memories a little,

13:17.530 --> 13:19.060
there'll be no evidence left!

13:19.680 --> 13:22.480
Yes, indeed...

13:22.480 --> 13:26.320
I was truly number two again today.

13:26.590 --> 13:29.200
The joy of supporting the false number one

13:29.200 --> 13:33.490
is the greatest joy for a
believer of the Second Faith.

13:33.840 --> 13:34.850
Yes.

13:34.850 --> 13:36.760
Orobas had no idea,

13:36.760 --> 13:41.090
but the netherworld religion that
loves and reveres the number two,

13:41.090 --> 13:43.750
the family of the Second Faith,

13:44.340 --> 13:46.840
actually existed.

13:46.840 --> 13:50.480
Now, I must hurry back to the revered one.

13:50.480 --> 13:52.760
I have so much information!

13:52.760 --> 13:54.890
Easy-peasy!

13:56.400 --> 13:58.400
I've spotted our target.

13:59.640 --> 14:00.890
All right.

14:01.280 --> 14:03.630
Two days with Shichiro's Buzzer...

14:03.630 --> 14:06.720
Another day after the new
instructor's investigation.

14:06.720 --> 14:09.230
It took quite a while to find them,

14:09.230 --> 14:11.170
but we finally got them by the tail.

14:11.770 --> 14:14.840
Babyls will accept every demon.

14:14.840 --> 14:18.650
But any fool that infiltrates
our school without permission

14:18.650 --> 14:21.180
will not get away unscathed.

14:24.230 --> 14:25.170
Right!

14:26.550 --> 14:30.180
The Balse family bloodline
ability, Bullseye Shot.

14:26.800 --> 14:30.180
Bullseye Shot

14:30.180 --> 14:32.170
Concentrate on one target!

14:32.220 --> 14:34.180
CONCENTRATE
ON ONE TARGET

14:35.970 --> 14:40.770
Once unleashed, the arrow will not
slow down until it reaches its target,

14:41.520 --> 14:46.000
and it'll always be a perfect shot.

14:49.430 --> 14:50.620
An arrow?!

14:52.200 --> 14:55.120
I've been found? That's impossible!

14:55.120 --> 15:00.720
They placed a spell on me
so I couldn't be recognized!

15:04.260 --> 15:07.650
I missed his vitals, just like I was asked,

15:07.650 --> 15:09.950
but are you sure that was okay?

15:10.440 --> 15:13.380
I don't know who's pulling the strings here,

15:13.870 --> 15:15.690
but this time was just a warning.

15:15.690 --> 15:18.980
If something like this happens again,

15:19.520 --> 15:21.140
we won't hold back.

15:21.980 --> 15:24.150
We'll give them some gruesome discipline.

15:24.500 --> 15:26.440
I see.

15:26.440 --> 15:31.040
Well done disciplining
the enemy today, newbie.

15:32.450 --> 15:33.820
What are you smiling about?

15:33.820 --> 15:35.300
Well, you know.

15:35.300 --> 15:39.680
You rarely ever compliment me,
so I was just happy.

15:40.450 --> 15:43.790
All right! Reward time!

15:49.340 --> 15:51.300
This stuff's great!

15:51.300 --> 15:53.170
One more!

15:54.040 --> 15:57.700
Don't get a big head just because
you were complimented once!

15:57.700 --> 15:59.960
You're six years...

15:59.960 --> 16:02.810
no, 666 years too young for the Daikoku Makyo!

16:04.820 --> 16:06.960
Jeez, they're so close.

16:06.960 --> 16:08.150
Yes...

16:08.150 --> 16:11.320
All right! Let's get the
bingo tournament started!

16:12.810 --> 16:14.380
Yay!

16:16.320 --> 16:17.320
Number 6.

16:16.320 --> 16:20.330
Knucklebone Mountain

16:16.320 --> 16:20.330
Reserved

16:17.320 --> 16:19.280
Yis! I'm just one away!

16:20.330 --> 16:22.830
Tournament

16:21.080 --> 16:22.820
66!

16:22.820 --> 16:25.360
Man, I'm not getting any in a row.

16:25.360 --> 16:27.260
Yis! Now I've got two lines
that are one away!

16:27.260 --> 16:30.000
I've never gotten a bingo in my life!

16:30.820 --> 16:33.840
That's just how life is sometimes.

16:36.030 --> 16:39.300
Hey, Kalego-kun. I think you have bingo.

16:39.300 --> 16:40.470
Hey, shut your—

16:40.470 --> 16:42.170
Hey! He's got a bingo over here!

16:40.470 --> 16:44.980
Tournament

16:43.460 --> 16:44.980
Hey, damn it!

16:44.970 --> 16:49.420
Here you go, Kalego-sensei!
Here's the first prize!

16:47.690 --> 16:49.980
Tournament

16:58.780 --> 17:01.080
Reporting...

17:01.980 --> 17:04.860
Among the first-years at Babyls,

17:04.860 --> 17:08.960
there are a number who may be
inclined to return to our origins.

17:10.580 --> 17:11.840
I believe...

17:12.930 --> 17:19.220
there are quite of few in the Misfit Class
who may have true potential, er...

17:20.220 --> 17:23.210
Baal-sama.

17:28.590 --> 17:32.230
So... why do you look so pathetic, Ocho?

17:35.240 --> 17:35.980
Damn it!

17:35.990 --> 17:40.080
Stupid dogs of Babyls!
You won't get away with this!

17:40.080 --> 17:43.150
I'll return this favor twofold!

17:43.150 --> 17:47.240
Damn it! You hear me?! I'll crush you!

17:48.240 --> 17:51.240
Shut up. Stop dirtying my floor.

17:51.240 --> 17:52.880
I'm sorry...

17:52.880 --> 17:55.380
So, what did you learn about Iruma?

17:56.230 --> 17:58.380
Yes, sir. Here.

18:00.650 --> 18:03.380
From the mic I stuck on his clothes...

18:03.780 --> 18:05.170
Three!

18:05.170 --> 18:06.430
Two!

18:06.430 --> 18:07.440
One!

18:07.440 --> 18:09.260
Start!

18:10.760 --> 18:12.120
Let's go, Lead-kun.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.130
Yeah!

18:25.200 --> 18:30.480
I must say, it was quite a sight,
seeing him fall into the depths of despair.

18:30.480 --> 18:33.840
His face when he was
suffering in agony was quite—

18:40.130 --> 18:42.970
Quite what?

18:43.880 --> 18:47.220
Amy Kiriwo-kun...

18:48.330 --> 18:51.450
You met Iruma-kun, Ocho-kun?

18:51.450 --> 18:52.850
Yes...

18:52.850 --> 18:54.230
What'd you do?

18:54.490 --> 18:57.420
What'd I do? Just my mission.

18:57.420 --> 18:59.520
I gathered information.

18:59.520 --> 19:02.490
Yes, and what exactly did that entail?

19:03.720 --> 19:06.250
Don't interfere just out of curiosity.

19:06.980 --> 19:09.530
He's my...

19:09.530 --> 19:11.380
I'm human...

19:11.920 --> 19:13.880
I'm human...

19:14.370 --> 19:16.500
I'm human...

19:19.660 --> 19:21.130
Human?

19:24.400 --> 19:26.400
I knew it.

19:26.920 --> 19:32.890
The child that appeared right after
Sullivan illegally entered the human world...

19:33.300 --> 19:35.670
I had a feeling...

19:35.670 --> 19:38.330
but this is definitely gonna be interesting.

19:38.330 --> 19:42.240
Human... Iruma-kun is human?

19:42.900 --> 19:45.030
Iruma-kun is...

19:46.750 --> 19:49.780
Hey, I told you to stop dirtying my floor.

19:49.780 --> 19:50.780
Huh?

19:54.780 --> 19:58.800
I was... I was thinking this whole time...

19:58.800 --> 20:01.370
You said you would never be in despair...

20:01.370 --> 20:05.940
So I was trying to figure out
how to put you into despair.

20:05.940 --> 20:08.520
Tell me, Iruma-kun...

20:08.520 --> 20:14.580
Will you be able to hold back
your despair when I eat you, too?

20:17.420 --> 20:19.460
I wanna see it. Oh, how I wanna see it!

20:19.460 --> 20:22.530
I want to see your face writhing in despair!

20:24.940 --> 20:28.170
Things are gonna get a bit
rowdy in the netherworld.

20:28.170 --> 20:31.180
We're not talking about some kids'
game like the Harvest Festival.

20:31.180 --> 20:33.480
What we're about to start

20:33.480 --> 20:37.500
is something that'll get you
tingling with excitement.

20:40.240 --> 20:41.250
A hunt.

21:08.530 --> 21:11.540
Knucklebone Mountain

21:08.530 --> 21:11.540
Reserved

21:11.750 --> 21:13.240
Chokehold!

21:19.500 --> 21:21.830
Well, why don't we take our leave?

21:21.830 --> 21:23.050
Great work.

21:23.050 --> 21:25.090
Y-You, too.

21:25.090 --> 21:28.920
Make sure you see
everyone home safely, host.

21:28.920 --> 21:30.920
Huh? Huh?!

21:30.920 --> 21:32.080
Thanks very much!

21:32.080 --> 21:33.440
Thanks very much!

21:33.440 --> 21:35.480
We served you with all our hearts!

21:35.490 --> 21:37.260
Yeah!

21:37.260 --> 21:40.680
Hey, wake up! Hello?

21:40.680 --> 21:42.870
Absolute chaos... Unacceptable.

21:42.870 --> 21:43.690
Unaccept...

21:43.690 --> 21:46.600
Yis, yis...

21:50.200 --> 21:54.210
Yes, next up, let us talk about
tying bulls to your limbs and...

21:54.950 --> 21:58.780
And so, the instructors' banquet
ended without issue,

21:58.780 --> 22:01.770
and the new instructor was ready
to be officially welcomed in.

22:01.770 --> 22:03.590
What the heck?!

23:34.980 --> 23:38.760
Suki suki su-ki-ma!

23:43.040 --> 23:45.910
My utmost priority is to
protect this precious room.

23:45.910 --> 23:47.910
This is my pledge.

23:48.280 --> 23:53.190
Any enemy that goes after our treasure
shall receive the gruesome "discipline."

23:53.200 --> 23:54.810
Cerberobuth!

23:59.780 --> 24:01.680
What?!

24:03.000 --> 24:27.980
Next Episode Preview

24:04.120 --> 24:07.120
Iruma-kun won at the Harvest Festival
and became the Young King.

24:07.120 --> 24:10.600
And he's not even a demon! He's human!

24:10.600 --> 24:12.340
He said he was human!

24:12.340 --> 24:16.270
I'm just filled with amusement, excitement,
and happiness, and it feels so good!

24:16.270 --> 24:19.000
One day, I'm gonna cook you and eat you up!

24:19.390 --> 24:21.160
Next time on <i>Welcome to
Demon School! Iruma-kun</i>,

24:21.160 --> 24:23.820
"Bad Company" and "Heartfelt Cooking Class."

24:23.820 --> 24:26.790
I can't wait until we meet again.
